With a voice heard from one end of the room to the other:

812
00:51:22,222 --> 00:51:25,522
「これがあのミルクのゴキブリかー！」って！
"So this is that milk cockroach?!"

813
00:51:26,222 --> 00:51:31,422
えー でも嬉しい！ 中身に興味持ってもらえて すごく嬉しい！ ありがとう！
But I'm glad! I'm so happy you're interested in the details! Thank you!

814
00:51:31,422 --> 00:51:34,722
解説が全部面白い！ ねー 面白い！
All the explanations are so interesting! Yeah, so fun!

815
00:51:34,722 --> 00:51:39,022
あー！ やったー！ 嬉しい！ ありがとう ありがとう！
Ah! Yay! I'm so glad! Thank you, thank you!

816
00:51:39,022 --> 00:51:45,022
